      "updated": 1770822042059,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Connect to Blob\nStorage\n2. List\nBuckets(Locations)\n3. List objects in\nBuckets\n4. Read Metadata\nfor each object\n5. Save metadata\ninto SQLite DB",
      "fontSize": 21.33437500000001,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Connect to Blob Storage\n2. List Buckets(Locations)\n3. List objects in Buckets\n4. Read Metadata for each object\n5. Save metadata into SQLite DB",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
